4 components, the ungated set.

| Component | Description | Options | Satisfies | Refuses |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `core/menu` | Collects a file, but declares no destination for it |  |  |  |
| `core/absent` | Contributes a file it does not ship, twice, out of range |  |  |  |
| `core/unclaimed` | Ships a collected filename nothing in this image collects |  |  |  |
| `core/shipper` | Ships a file whose collector is enabled but refused |  |  |  |
